<li>&lt;a href="Galileo%20%28sistem%20navigasi%20satelit%29"&gt;Galileo&lt;/a&gt; — Sistem sing lagi dikembangaké déning &lt;a href="Uni%20%C3%89ropah"&gt;Uni Éropah&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi bantuan saka &lt;a href="RRC"&gt;RRC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maroko"&gt;Maroko&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Arab%20Saudi"&gt;Arab Saudi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kor%C3%A9a%20Kidul"&gt;Koréa Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="GLONASS"&gt;GLONASS&lt;/a&gt; — Sistemduwèké &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; sing lagi didandani.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Indian%20Regional%20Navigational%20Satellite%20System"&gt;Indian Regional Navigational Satellite System&lt;/a&gt; (IRNSS) — Sistem sing dikembangaké déning &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
